<title>USA: Tom Brown closes Presidio acquisition.</title>
<headline>Tom Brown closes Presidio acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MIDLAND, Texas 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tom Brown Inc said on Tuesday that it has closed the previously announced acquisition of Presidio Oil Co.</p>
<p>The net consideration paid was about $105 million in cash and 2.71 million shares of Tom Brown common stock.</p>
</text>
